# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# v5.22.15 — secret containment, defence in depth.
# The Dockerfile COPYs named directories (app/ alembic/ tools/ docs/ frontend/)
# rather than `COPY . .`, so these never reach the image today. They are
# excluded anyway because (a) the whole context is still shipped to the
# daemon, and (b) the day someone adds a broad COPY, the DB and key material
# must not silently ride along into a Docker Hub image.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Databases, dumps, backups — key hashes, encrypted_key blobs, OAuth tokens
data/
backups/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bak
*.dump

# Key material
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# Secret-Handling Protocol (docs/SECRET-HANDLING-PROTOCOL.md). Keep in step
# with .gitignore, frontend/.gitignore, frontend/eslint.config.js and
# BLOCKED_PATH_RE in .githooks/_lib.sh.
secrets-sealed-*
**/secrets-sealed-*
*credentials-backup*
**/*credentials-backup*
*.key
**/*.key

# Host-side migration tools run from a verified root-owned installation.
tools/uid640_backup.py
tools/uid640_config.py
tools/uid640_ownership.py
Dockerfile.uid640

# Restrict build context to public runtime documentation and operator utility.
docs/**
!docs/draft-blagbrough-lmrh-00.md
!docs/lmrh-2.0-bidirectional.md
tools/**
!tools/__init__.py
!tools/cleanup_alias_collisions.py
